      "rationale": "A perfect self‑correlation (0.998 for pendulum_lab, 1.000 for resonator_obs) and the unusually long exact repeat run (132/271) are far more likely to arise from systematic duplication or rounding in the logging pipeline than from any physical process that would preserve values to 1 µs across weeks.",
