      "rationale": "If each instrument is reset on a specific weekday, it could generate a weekly imprint unique to that device. The lack of synchrony between instruments fits this idea, but it still does not explain exact value matches.",
      "evidenceFor": ["cross_corr_pl_7d", "cross_corr_ro_7d"],
